   "subject": "invalid 'times' argument while creating gene object",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">Hi authors,<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">I am trying to pass a bed file as a gene object in methylkit and face the error :<br><br>&gt; library(methylKit)<br>&gt; gene.obj&lt;- read.transcript.features(&quot;Amel.bed&quot;)<br>Error in rep(1:nrow(ref), ref[, 10]) : invalid &#39;times&#39; argument<br><br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">I looked into the forum  where you have suggested that there might be some &#39;NA&#39; in the file and hence the error. As for this bedfile, everything looks okay. I am not sure if I am missing something. Could you please help me with this.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">I had a gff3 file (ref_Amel_4.5_top_level.gff3) from (<a href=\"http://mirrors.vbi.vt.edu/mirrors/ftp.ncbi.nih.gov/genomes/Apis_mellifera/GFF/ref_Amel_4.5_top_level.gff3.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mirrors.vbi.vt.edu/mirrors/ftp.ncbi.nih.gov/genomes/Apis_mellifera/GFF/ref_Amel_4.5_top_level.gff3.gz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793233999479000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29KOTaOyvijvXde090orgr\">http://mirrors.vbi.vt.edu/mirrors/ftp.ncbi.nih.gov/genomes/Apis_mellifera/GFF/ref_Amel_4.5_top_level.gff3.gz</a>)<br>which I converted using a python script gff3_to_bed_converter.py and got the 12 column bed file(Amel.bed)<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">I have attached all the files for your reference. Could you please help me with this?<br><br><br clear=\"all\"></div><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><font><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Sincerely,</span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><font><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Saranya Sankaranarayanan</span></font></span></div><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><font><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Master&#39;s Student, SoIC</span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><font><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Indiana University</span></font></span></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "m98JO17bugkJ",
   "from": "Kalyan K Pasumarthy",
