   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Saranya,<div><br></div><div>The main problem seems to the names of the chromosomes. Try to replace the transcript ids (column1) with the chromosome numbers. It works. </div><div><br></div><div> I could reproduce the error with your bed file. I could overcome the error by replacing the names of the transcripts (NM......) with &#39;chr1, chr2........&#39; in a subset of the data..</div><div><br></div><div hspace=\"streak-pt-mark\" style=\"max-height:1px\"><img style=\"width:0px;max-height:0px\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/8k06o01I6LfXSFv66f10QGVUJWisT3TPRWnvrkefP2pk9JX0CdDZ3N5mOP7GG9Ut9beoSq1sIwTNRdSKYZnGdMZP3O8SpKLhkAqWUaV0BdkINf2btp7mxYAVeJ_Xi7K9-abJ0OGbVEfSv78OTfiXBuCFdqAohm1t7B_os2DJVFoKauO0tv7f5fKXGM1Mv1CjShI8uwIPh-s=s0-d-e1-ft#https://mailfoogae.appspot.com/t?sender=aa2FseWFua3B5QGdtYWlsLmNvbQ%3D%3D&amp;type=zerocontent&amp;guid=826d07d3-4d21-430f-af05-e31b95883377\"><font color=\"#ffffff\" size=\"1\">ᐧ</font></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Regards,<br>Kalyan<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:auto;height:30px;font-size:0px\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:auto\"><div style=\"line-height:0\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:48px;line-height:1;vertical-align:top\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\"><br></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width:8px;font-size:0px\"><br></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width:auto;height:48px;line-height:1;padding:0px;vertical-align:middle\" valign=\"middle\" align=\"left\"><br></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t</div></td></tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr><td style=\"width:auto;height:20px;font-size:0px\"> </td></tr>\r\n\t\t</tbody>\r\n\t</table>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<br></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On 4 November 2014 20:48, Saranya Sankaranarayanan <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sara...@umail.iu.edu</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">Hi authors,<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">I am trying to pass a bed file as a gene object in methylkit and face the error :<br><br>&gt; library(methylKit)<br>&gt; gene.obj&lt;- read.transcript.features(&quot;Amel.bed&quot;)<br>Error in rep(1:nrow(ref), ref[, 10]) : invalid &#39;times&#39; argument<br><br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">I looked into the forum  where you have suggested that there might be some &#39;NA&#39; in the file and hence the error. As for this bedfile, everything looks okay. I am not sure if I am missing something. Could you please help me with this.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">I had a gff3 file (ref_Amel_4.5_top_level.gff3) from (<a href=\"http://mirrors.vbi.vt.edu/mirrors/ftp.ncbi.nih.gov/genomes/Apis_mellifera/GFF/ref_Amel_4.5_top_level.gff3.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mirrors.vbi.vt.edu/mirrors/ftp.ncbi.nih.gov/genomes/Apis_mellifera/GFF/ref_Amel_4.5_top_level.gff3.gz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793233999481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Lf1eSOTIYmlQZ2m3EFiFU\">http://mirrors.vbi.vt.edu/mirrors/ftp.ncbi.nih.gov/genomes/Apis_mellifera/GFF/ref_Amel_4.5_top_level.gff3.gz</a>)<br>which I converted using a python script gff3_to_bed_converter.py and got the 12 column bed file(Amel.bed)<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(11,83,148)\">I have attached all the files for your reference. Could you please help me with this?<br><br><br clear=\"all\"></div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><font><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Sincerely,</span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><font><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Saranya Sankaranarayanan</span></font></span></div><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><font><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Master&#39;s Student, SoIC</span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(11,83,148)\"><font><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">Indiana University</span></font></span></div></div></div></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
